✨[PLA Filament Features]- Transparent Multicolor Filament from green, red to blue with a touch of silver glitter, just like colorful butterflies in the forest, elegant and charming!
✨[Filament Parameter]-iSANMATE PLA Filament Print Temperature: 190 - 220℃, Recommended Temp:200℃. Printing Speed: 40-130mm/s, iSANMATE PLA filament dimensional: 1.75mm,accuracy +/- 0.03mm;
✨[High Quality]- PLA filament has superb layer bonding, and Impact Resistant and toughness are greater than conventional PLA filament;
✨[100% Satisfactory Service]- Provide fast and efficient technical solutions when you have any printing problems With 24 hours guaranteed reply;
✨[Vacuum sealed packaging]- iSANMATE 3D printing filament is carefully vacuum packed with desiccant to maintain the performance of PLA filament and prevent dust and foreign matter from entering.
